== Frequently Asked Questions ==

1. What other payout options Affiliate for WooCommerce provide?

* [Manual payouts](https://woocommerce.com/document/affiliate-for-woocommerce/#section-23) via PayPal, Stripe & bank transfers
* [Automated payouts via PayPal & Stripe](https://woocommerce.com/document/affiliate-for-woocommerce/how-to-set-up-automated-commission-payouts-for-affiliates/)
* [Reward Points](https://woocommerce.com/document/affiliate-for-woocommerce/how-to-pay-reward-points-as-affiliate-commission/) (only mark)

2. Does Affiliate for WooCommerce support WooCommerce Subscriptions?

Yes. It allows you to provide commissions to affiliates on [parent subscription orders and renewals](https://woocommerce.com/document/affiliate-for-woocommerce/how-to-set-different-affiliate-commission-rates-for-subscription-parent-and-renewal-orders/).

3. Can affiliate use store credit for subscription renewals?

Yes, store credit is applied at initial signup and if sufficient balance, it will automatically apply to future renewals until it's used up. Works with [WooCommerce Subscriptions](https://woocommerce.com/products/woocommerce-subscriptions/) plugin.

4. Does this require any coding?

Not at all. It’s very easy.

